  mod_kinds_lib.pcpp - Module compliance: the lib kind (part of mod_kinds.pcpp)

  module lib emits a static library (BNF.md sec 1): no begin body, the module
  ends with end. alone. Linking a lib into a program is lib_plain.pcpp's.

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\mod_kinds_lib.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\mod_kinds_lib.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The build succeeds and reports nothing.
  CHECK: output\lib holds mod_kinds_lib.lib (windows) or
  libmod_kinds_lib.a (linux)

  Break it: mod_kinds_err_body.pcpp (a begin body in a lib).
*******************************************************************************/

module lib mod_kinds_lib;

exported routine clink mod_kinds_lib_twice(AX: int32): int32;
begin
  return AX * 2;
end;

end.
